{"data": [{"author_id": "1988454162057826304", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:23:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114482888561533337"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GDHsyQVXzQ", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114482888561533337/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114482122983632896", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/GDHsyQVXzQ"}]}, "id": "2114482888561533337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3574, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA'S CUSTOM HBM COULD FORCE SAMSUNG TO RELY ON TSMC: THE MEMORY CHIP RACE IS CHANGING\n\nTIL: Samsung could eventually find itself relying on its biggest foundry rival, TSMC, to manufacture a key component of its own HBM.\n\nAccording to Chosun Ilbo, Korea's largest daily https://t.co/GDHsyQVXzQ", "url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114482888561533337"}, {"author_id": "1986901942216630272", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:28:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114469106497753155"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "AMKR"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GZGBWWnePU", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2114469106497753155/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114469098511851520", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/GZGBWWnePU"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/GZGBWWnePU", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2114469106497753155/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114469098537078784", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/GZGBWWnePU"}]}, "id": "2114469106497753155", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 733, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$AMKR  $39.30 — NVIDIA packaging is real. $58 chase is not.\n\nAmkor broke under the lower daily Keltner ($40.55) and sits −4.41% under dynamic VWAP ($41.11). Weekly Bearish. Vol acceleration on the way down. Weekly cloud still at $57.53–$62.90.