ten: AI Usage Growth Meets"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:16:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114481310114996436"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114480992891408384", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114480992891408384", "url": "https://t.co/67REoKpCGo"}]}, "id": "2114481310114996436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1212, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/67REoKpCGo", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2114481310114996436"}, {"article": {"title": "AI 学习笔记之 Where is the money?"}, "author_id": "53785964", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:45:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114473522777006309"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2111…", "end": 52, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2111925284614320128", "start": 29, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2111925284614320128", "url": "https://t.co/Sidhk1tolC"}]}, "id": "2114473522777006309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6901, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 学习笔记之 Where is the money? https://t.co/Sidhk1tolC", "url": "https://x.com/jliu18/status/2114473522777006309"}, {"author_id": "1680092936544092160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114462000944238968"], "id": "2114462000944238968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 761, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI时代，谁才是真正的卖铲人？\n\n英伟达NVDA、博通AVGO、台积电TSM、阿斯麦ASML。\n\n如果未来10年只能持有其中一只。\n\n你选谁？", "url": "https://x.com/DesertCamelX/status/2114462000944238968"}, {"author_id": "1543510092447813635", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:07:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463882362376584"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "삼성전자가 올해 3분기 HBM(고대역폭메모리) 매출에서 SK하이닉스를 추월했을 가능성이 제기되면서 이번 주 양사의 실적 발표에 관심이 커지고 있다. 지난 2분기 양사의 시장 점유율 격차는 절반 이상 줄어든 바 있다. 25일 업계에 따르면 SK하이닉스는 오는 28일, 삼", "display_url": "m.metroseoul.co.kr/article/202610…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://m.metroseoul.co.kr/article/20261025500237", "images": [{"height": 341, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114463895863877632/eDZ5LKrr?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 512}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114463895863877632/eDZ5LKrr?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 232, "status": 200, "title": "삼성 HBM 매출, 하닉 추월하나…이번주 양사 실적 발표 촉각", "unwound_url": "https://m.metroseoul.co.kr/article/20261025500237", "url": "https://t.co/Sgztv76VP1"}]}, "id": "2114463882362376584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bernstein thinks Samsung's Q3 HBM revenue ($8.7B) passed SK hynix ($7.6B).\n\nCatch: it's modeled off Korean export data, not reported numbers.\n\nWe find out Oct 28/29. Either way, HBM being a 2-horse race isn't a meme anymore. IYKYK\n\nhttps://t.co/Sgztv76VP1", "url": "https://x.com/rokhardsolid/status/2114463882362376584"}, {"author_id": "174073808", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:06:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114478795490996701"], "id": "2114478795490996701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Daily Semi Analytics: SK hynix into Tuesday's print, record profits vs. a shrinking HBM4 lead\n\nSK hynix reports Tuesday. The setup is unusual: consensus calls for the biggest quarter in its history, yet the debate is whether it is losing its grip on HBM4 to Samsung.\n\n1. The", "url": "https://x.com/xiangwei36/status/2114478795490996701"}, {"author_id": "27643159", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114478299669807212"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jongsytse/stat…", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jongsytse/status/2114427694054023520", "start": 199, "url": "https://t.co/TYZ2mT1Fb5"}]}, "id": "2114478299669807212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114427694054023520", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Hahahaha, die groep vertrekt ook meteen als er ergens anders in de wereld een andere ASML opstaat het er meer loon en benefiet te verdienen valt. \nHet zijn de de niet ASML’ers die het probleem zijn. https://t.co/TYZ2mT1Fb5", "url": "https://x.com/ToontjeD/status/2114478299669807212"}, {"author_id": "1962246440975052800", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:19:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114466920363876646"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "ASML"}]}, "id": "2114466920363876646", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ASML says demand exceeds supply through 2028 and is exploring 110+ EUV tools that year. CFET transitions past gate-all-around guarantee multi-node litho intensity no index basket replicates. Only China normalization and High-NA dilution cap it.", "url": "https://x.com/quantumboomnow/status/2114466920363876646"}, {"author_id": "1968302536697217024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463258480701456"], "id": "2114463258480701456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 468, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "samsung is reportedly charging up to ~25% more than micron and hynix for HBM, and customers are paying it\n\nnot long ago the whole story was samsung falling behind in HBM. memory is such a strange business", "url": "https://x.com/_stockResearch/status/2114463258480701456"}, {"author_id": "393685526", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:29:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114484604392620496"], "id": "2114484604392620496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One interesting constraint on AI infrastructure is the tradeoff between HBM and conventional DRAM.\n\nHBM is increasingly prioritized for AI chips, but both compete for the same manufacturing capacity.\n\nAs AI demand grows, that leaves less capacity for traditional memory.", "url": "https://x.com/Ameshsarecha/status/2114484604392620496"}, {"author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:18:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114466577533780363"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Yi9z9RpRJx", "end": 209, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2114466577533780363/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114466574987878400", "start": 186, "url": "https://t.co/Yi9z9RpRJx"}]}, "id": "2114466577533780363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SEDEX에서 삼성과 SK가 HBM4E를 보여줬는데 핀 속도가 최대 16Gbps까지 올라갔더라고.\n\n대역폭은 3.6TB/s에 12단 제품이 48GB라니 용량도 꽤 커졌네.\n\nUBS 보고서 보니까 삼성 D램 웨이퍼가 올해 4분기 70만 장에서 내년 4분기 82만 장으로 늘어나는데 대부분이 HBM 쪽으로 간다는 거야.\n\n2분기 HBM https://t.co/Yi9z9RpRJx", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2114466577533780363"}, {"author_id": "920509164857774081", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:27:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114468814914216214"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wzQegLfReB", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Johoshushupopo/status/2114468814914216214/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114467920327921664", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/wzQegLfReB"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Johoshushupopo…", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Johoshushupopo/status/2114166252189155641", "start": 108, "url": "https://t.co/R95oKZHgCQ"}]}, "id": "2114468814914216214", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 8279, "like_count": 93, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114166252189155641", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "キヤノンはASMLが手薄のi線(365nm)を上手く市場開拓出来たと言うことかも\n\n※キヤノンの2017年～2022年の機種別台数は探し方が良くないのか見つからず・・ https://t.co/wzQegLfReB https://t.co/R95oKZHgCQ", "url": "https://x.com/Johoshushupopo/status/2114468814914216214"}, {"author_id": "1235248732440064000", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:00:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114462171400659217"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Samsung’s HBM supply chain edge is reportedly commanding a premium of up to 25%, with data center customers willing to pay for assured volumes", "display_url": "wccftech.com/samsung-hbm-pr…", "end": 187, "expanded_url": "https://wccftech.com/samsung-hbm-pricing-premium-data-center-supply-chain/?type=Enterprise", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114462174512840704/dVJzys9O?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114462174512840704/dVJzys9O?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 164, "status": 200, "title": "Data Center Customers Are Reportedly Footing A Bigger Bill For A Superior HBM Supply Chain, Where Samsung Has An Edge, As It’s Estimated To Charge Up To 25% Extra", "unwound_url": "https://wccftech.com/samsung-hbm-pricing-premium-data-center-supply-chain/?type=Enterprise", "url": "https://t.co/pJ0KyEb9JW"}]}, "id": "2114462171400659217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Data Center Customers Are Reportedly Footing A Bigger Bill For A Superior HBM Supply Chain, Where Samsung Has An Edge, As It’s Estimated To Charge Up To 25% Extra\n\nhttps://t.co/pJ0KyEb9JW", "url": "https://x.